  "limitations": [
    "Deterministic replay reproduces captured behavior; it is not another model evaluation or a causal intervention on model understanding.",
    "Correctness labels are the original sealed model reviews, not new human adjudication. No baseline label was changed.",
    "Reference-patch controls establish that the runtime can execute these annotated repairs and preserve annotated unrelated records. Their semantic correctness depends on existing review and separate diagnostic source inspection.",
